        "y0": 0.10458557046979866,
        "x1": 0.30522565320665085,
        "y1": 0.12919463087248317
      },
      "text": "You have not replied to the claim form",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09857482185273159,
        "y0": 0.12701342281879202,
        "x1": 0.5787802850356295,
        "y1": 0.2270687919463088
      },
      "text": "It is therefore ordered that you must pay the claimant the balance in th ominated supreme court account (of $85,000,000 which at today’s rate of exchange being 0.79 to one GBP converts to GBP equivalent of66,619,0$7.05 together with any interest which has accrued on that amount) and £10,185 for costs forthwith.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09659501187648456,
        "y0": 0.24832214765100669,
        "x1": 0.5193978622327792,
        "y1": 0.3176728187919463
      },
      "text": "If you ignore this order your goods may be removed and sold, or other enforcement may be taken against you. If this happens further costs will be added. If your circumstances change and you cannot pay, ask at the court office what you can do.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "heading",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16112470308788598,
        "y0": 0.3238255033557047,
        "x1": 0.29493230403800474,
        "y1": 0.34731543624161076
      },
      "text": "Notes for the defendant",
      "html": null,
      "level": 1,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
